WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.930
When selling in the Amazon store, you are in control of how you price your products based on supply

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:10.340
and demand trends.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:16.249
We recommend prioritizing your customer's satisfaction as your pricing strategy impacts your seller

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.260
identity and long-term success.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:24.584
We monitor pricing practices that may harm customer trust and notify you of any policy violations

00:00:24.584 --> 00:00:26.560
in the Account Health dashboard.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:32.231
To ensure your success, avoid setting misleading reference prices, setting excessive shipping fees,

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:38.060
or selling bundled units at a price greater than prices of individual units sold together.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.906
Remember that the price you select in your account is the final price the customer will pay you.

00:00:43.906 --> 00:00:45.380
It already includes Amazon fees.

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:51.260
Avoid pricing your products significantly higher than recent prices offered on or off Amazon.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:58.040
By violating this policy, you may risk your account health rating, put your account at risk of being

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:01.440
deactivated, or lose the ability to become the featured offer.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.440
The featured offer is the price that appears at the top of a product.

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:11.119
Multiple sellers can offer the same product on Amazon, and your offer may become the featured offer

00:01:11.119 --> 00:01:12.380
if you become eligible.

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:16.100
Unfair prices may also impact your customer's loyalty.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:22.352
For example, when you price products like makeup differently based on skin tone, you risk upsetting

00:01:22.352 --> 00:01:24.100
customers and receiving negative feedback.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:29.378
To protect your account health, we recommend maintaining consistent pricing across all variations

00:01:29.378 --> 00:01:30.480
of your product.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.720
We actively monitor and flag prices that violate our policies.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:39.308
For more information about pricing, policies, and ways to automate your pricing,

00:01:39.308 --> 00:01:41.940
review our pricing help pages in Seller Central.
